<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Portal clientes - BIODATA</title>
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Plus+Jakarta+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <link rel="icon" href="/img/biodata-logo.svg" type="image/svg+xml">
  <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
  <link href="/theme.css" rel="stylesheet">
  <style>
    body { font-family: "Plus Jakarta Sans", "Segoe UI", sans-serif; }
  </style>
</head>
<body class="min-h-screen flex items-center justify-center px-4" style="background:#070b12">
  <div class="w-full max-w-md">
    <div class="text-center mb-8">
      <img src="/img/biodata-logo.svg" alt="BIODATA" class="h-14 w-14 rounded-xl mx-auto mb-4">
      <h1 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white tracking-tight">Portal de clientes</h1>
      <p class="text-slate-400 text-sm mt-2">Consulta tus equipos y la próxima mantención</p>
    </div>

    <% if (error) { %>
      <div class="bg-red-500/20 border border-red-500/50 text-red-200 text-sm px-4 py-3 rounded-xl mb-6 text-center">
        <%= error %>
      </div>
    <% } %>

    <div class="bg-slate-900/80 border border-slate-800 rounded-2xl p-6 shadow-xl">
      <form action="/portal/login" method="POST" class="space-y-4">
        <div>
          <label class="block text-xs font-medium text-slate-400 mb-1 uppercase tracking-wider">Correo</label>
          <input type="email" name="email" required autocomplete="username"
            value="<%= typeof email !== 'undefined' && email ? email : '' %>"
            class="w-full bg-slate-950/50 border border-slate-700 rounded-xl px-4 py-3 text-white focus:ring-2 focus:ring-teal-400 outline-none"
            placeholder="cliente@empresa.cl">
        </div>
        <div>
          <label class="block text-xs font-medium text-slate-400 mb-1 uppercase tracking-wider">Clave</label>
          <input type="password" name="password" required autocomplete="current-password"
            class="w-full bg-slate-950/50 border border-slate-700 rounded-xl px-4 py-3 text-white focus:ring-2 focus:ring-teal-400 outline-none"
            placeholder="••••••••">
        </div>
        <button type="submit" class="w-full font-semibold py-3 rounded-xl transition-all"
          style="background:linear-gradient(180deg,#2dd4bf,#14b8a6);color:#042f2e;box-shadow:0 10px 24px -10px rgba(20,184,166,.7)">
          Entrar al portal
        </button>
      </form>
      <p class="text-[11px] text-slate-500 mt-4 text-center leading-relaxed">
        Las credenciales se envían por correo cuando BIODATA registra tu ficha de mantención.
        Solo ves los equipos de tu organización.
      </p>
    </div>

    <p class="text-center mt-6 text-sm text-slate-500">
      ¿Eres del equipo BIODATA?
      <a href="/" class="text-teal-300 hover:text-cyan-300">Ir al sistema interno</a>
    </p>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
